# Mechanical: what a machine writes for any contract. Complete and visible, and not pleasant.

SCREEN Home ABOUT Alice:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Alice: identity, person
    LIST People: PERSONS WITH knows, member, listed, proposed, delivered, vote_for, vote_against, delivered_vote, delivered_decision OPENS Person
    LIST Steward: "Alice is the steward of Delos"
    LIST Proposal: "Alice holds Prop of Delos"
    LIST Decided: "Alice has decided Prop of Delos"
    LIST Voted: "Alice has voted on Prop of Delos"
    LIST Passed: "Alice holds Prop of Delos as passed"
    LIST Rejected: "Alice holds Prop of Delos as rejected"
    Establish: Alice may establish an identity
    Acquaint: Alice and Bob may jointly come to know each other, Bob TYPED
    Introduce: Alice may introduce Carol to Bob, Bob FROM knows, Carol FROM knows
    Found: Alice may found Delos under a new name of hers, Delos TYPED
    Join: Alice may admit Bob to Delos, Bob FROM knows, Delos FROM steward
    Propose: Alice may make the proposal Prop to Bob's Delos, Bob FROM member, Prop TYPED, Delos FROM member
    Propose own: Alice may make the proposal Prop to Alice's Delos, Prop TYPED, Delos FROM member
    Vote for: Alice may vote for Prop of Bob's Delos, Bob FROM member, Prop FROM proposal, Delos FROM member
    Vote own for: Alice may vote for Prop of Alice's Delos, Prop FROM proposal, Delos FROM member
    Vote against: Alice may vote against Prop of Bob's Delos, Bob FROM member, Prop FROM proposal, Delos FROM member
    Vote own against: Alice may vote against Prop of Alice's Delos, Prop FROM proposal, Delos FROM member
    Pass: Alice may pass Prop of Delos, Prop FROM proposal, Delos FROM steward
    Reject: Alice may reject Prop of Delos, Prop FROM proposal, Delos FROM steward

SCREEN Person ABOUT Bob:
    QUESTIONS
    SHOW Bob: knows, member, listed, proposed, delivered, vote_for, vote_against, delivered_vote, delivered_decision
